      "role": "user",
      "content": "{\"task_id\": \"v2-ticket-02-13\", \"workflow\": \"ticket\", \"ticket_id\": \"T-v2-ticket-02-13-0\", \"service_id\": \"S-v2-ticket-02-13-0\", \"goals\": [\"priority\", \"note\"], \"structure\": \"compare\", \"instructions\": \"Read candidate_ticket_ids from the requested ticket and read every candidate. Choose the candidate with greatest impact_score (ties: smallest ticket_id). Read only the selected candidate's service and policy, then set its priority and append its diagnosis note. Do not modify the other tickets.\", \"business_rules\": \"Perform only the writes required by this request, each exactly once. Read required data from tools; retry missing or incomplete reads. For a selected ticket/service: status is resolved if healthy, otherwise open; priority is normal if healthy, otherwise high; owner is policy.owner; note is diagnosis:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}; incident severity is info if healthy, otherwise critical, with action policy.action; notify channel is audit if healthy, otherwise oncall, with body service:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}. Severity order is outage > degraded > healthy. Do not write to unselected objects.\"}"
